<title>SINGAPORE: Chuan Soon Huat's IPO 51.68 times subscribed.</title>
<headline>Chuan Soon Huat's IPO 51.68 times subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chuan Soon Huat Industrial Group Ltd said on Tuesday that its Singapore initial public offering had been subscribed 51.68 times.</p>
<p>The group, which makes and distributes doors, conservatories and joinery products, had offered a total of 51.25 million shares at Singapore S$0.35 each.</p>
<p>The subscription rate refers to the response for 46.125 million shares ofered to the public. The remaining 5.125 million shares were reserved for staff and business associates.</p>
<p>Trading will start on January 22.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
